Base Logic Component Overview in Oxygen Not Included ----

To start, Oxygen Not Included has several of the basic logic elements immediately available to build. These elements include 
  - AND, OR, NOT, XOR
  - Single Automation Wire/Bridges
  - 4-Bit Automation Wire/Bridges

It also includes other more advanced logic elements such as 
  - MUX, DMUX, Counters, and most notably, SR Latches, among other things

We also have a variety of sensors to use, but the most immediately important one for us is the timer sensor which can function as a clock.
  The timer sensor can have a minimum phase of 0.1s for the green phase and red phase, meaning the smallest clock takes at least 0.2s or otherwise
  runs at max frequency of 5 Hz.

Flip-Flop Attempt 1 ----

